{
    "type": "page",
    "title": "住房公积金缴存断缴风险",
    "initApi": {
        "method": "get",
        "url": "/api/demo/header-info"
    },
    "subTitle": "${displayText}",
    "titleClassName": "text-center",
    "bodyClassName": "p-3",
    "style": {
        "backgroundColor": "#f7f8fa"
    },
    "css": {
        ".cxd-Page-toolbar": {
            "position": "absolute",
            "top": "15px",
            "right": "20px",
            "z-index": "10"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-title": {
            "text-align": "center",
            "width": "100%",
            "margin-top": "10px",
            "margin-bottom": "0",
            "font-size": "24px",
            "font-weight": "600",
            "color": "#1d1d1f"
        },
        ".cxd-Page-subTitle": {
            "text-align": "center",
            "width": "100%",
            "margin-top": "10px",
            "margin-bottom": "20px",
            "color": "#666",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "font-size": "13px"
        }
    },
    "toolbar": [
        {
            "type": "button",
            "label": "生成风险分析报告",
            "level": "danger",
            "actionType": "dialog",
            "dialog": {
                "title": "生成风险分析报告",
                "size": "lg",
                "body": {
                    "type": "form",
                    "api": "post:/api/report/generate",
                    "body": [
                        {
                            "type": "select",
                            "name": "report_type",
                            "label": "报告类型",
                            "options": [
                                {
                                    "label": "月度分析报告",
                                    "value": "month"
                                },
                                {
                                    "label": "季度分析报告",
                                    "value": "quarter"
                                }
                            ],
                            "required": true
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "input-date-range",
                            "name": "date_range",
                            "label": "时间范围",
                            "required": true
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "textarea",
                            "name": "remark",
                            "label": "备注说明"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "body": [
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='margin-bottom: 12px;'><div style='background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 24px; line-height: 1.7;'><div style='color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #1890ff;'>定义与分类</div><div style='margin-bottom: 20px;'><div style='color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>风险定义</div><div style='color: #333; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: justify;'>缴存异常风险是指公积金缴存单位因缴款不符合法定规范，或未正常缴纳、缴款异常中断等导致的公积金合规性风险。</div></div><div style='margin-bottom: 0;'><div style='color: #1890ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;'>风险分类</div><div style='padding-left: 0; margin-top: 10px;'><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>1. 开户风险单位：单位/个人违法开户（伪造账户开户、使用多余名义开户、以违法事由开户），无实则真正注册证照，或违反规缴规定。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>2. 缴存赋异常风险：缴存基数/比例与申报工资不匹配入额不符（意愿/虚报），频繁调整存档入额数据。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>3. 人员赋配风险：单位违规批准入数，需承赋承，信用性已过信报性法与正常公积金投资。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>4. 补缴赋配风险：违规未通用补缴违规法定规范虚报，无正常性入信为，以错误针对初次。</div><div style='color: #555; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 24px; text-indent: -24px; text-align: justify;'>5. 应缴赋异缴批：公积金蓝莓赔验板局，缴存照赋通过批量直接板局，民过统规范应方法性，驾过规范赔验应趴。</div></div></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
            "type": "tpl",
            "tpl": "<div style='text-align: center; color: #999; font-size: 12px; padding: 20px 0;'>XXX 公积金管理中心 © 2024</div>"
        }
    ]
}